ication information"},{"text":"Lifestyle"},{"text":"Nutrition-related symptoms"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Diagnosis"},{"type":"p","text":"Identify nutrition-related problems using appropriate professional terminology."},{"type":"h","text":"Intervention"},{"type":"h","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Energy targets"},{"text":"Protein targets"},{"text":"Meal plans"},{"text":"Therapeutic modifications"},{"text":"Nutrition education"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Monitoring"},{"type":"h","text":"Track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Weight"},{"text":"Intake"},{"text":"Symptoms"},{"text":"Laboratory trends"},{"text":"Dietary adherence"},{"text":"Clinical outcomes"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Therapeutic Nutrition"},{"type":"h","text":"Develop strong knowledge of:"},{"type":"h","text":"Diabetes"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Carbohydrate management"},{"text":"Meal timing"},{"text":"Glycemic control"},{"text":"Weight management"},{"text":"Patient education"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Renal Nutrition"},{"type":"h","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sodium"},{"text":"Potassium"},{"text":"Phosphorus"},{"text":"Protein"},{"text":"Fluid"},{"text":"Dialysis-related nutrition"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Cardiovascular Nutrition"},{"type":"h","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sodium reduction"},{"text":"Dietary fat quality"},{"text":"Fibre"},{"text":"Weight management"},{"text":"Heart-healthy dietary patterns"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Gastrointestinal Nutrition"},{"type":"h","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Malabsorption"},{"text":"Food intolerance"},{"text":"Inflammatory bowel conditions"},{"text":"Liver disease"},{"text":"Pancreatic disorders"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Critical-Care Nutrition"},{"type":"h","text":"Develop foundational knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ICU nutrition"},{"text":"Nutrition-risk screening"},{"text":"Enteral feeding"},{"text":"Parenteral nutrition"},{"text":"Protein requirements"},{"text":"Energy requirements"},{"text":"Refeeding risk"},{"text":"Electrolyte considerations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Clinical nutrition in critically ill patients requires close coordination with physicians, nurses, pharmacists and other members of the multidisciplinary team."},{"type":"h","text":"Paediatric Nutrition"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Infant nutrition"},{"text":"Breastfeeding"},{"text":"Complementary feeding"},{"text":"Growth monitoring"},{"text":"Childhood obesity"},{"text":"Malnutrition"},{"text":"Developmental nutrition"},{"text":"Special feeding requirements"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Oncology Nutrition"},{"type":"h","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cancer-related malnutrition"},{"text":"Cachexia"},{"text":"Treatment-related nutrition problems"},{"text":"Appetite loss"},{"text":"Oral intake difficulties"},{"text":"Nutrition support"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital & Data Skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Modern dietetics increasingly uses digital tools."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"EHR systems"},{"text":"Nutrition-analysis software"},{"text":"Dietary databases"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Basic statistics"},{"text":"Data visualization"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Useful analytics"},{"type":"h","text":"Track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Weight changes"},{"text":"BMI trends"},{"text":"Dietary intake"},{"text":"Nutritional risk"},{"text":"Patient adherence"},{"text":"Clinical outcomes"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI & Nutrition"},{"type":"p","text":"AI is increasingly entering personalized nutrition and clinical decision support."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn about:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Personalized diet recommendation systems"},{"text":"Nutrition chatbots"},{"text":"Food-image recognition"},{"text":"Automated dietary analysis"},{"text":"Predictive nutrition models"},{"text":"Clinical decision-support systems"},{"text":"Digital therapeutics"}]},{