-related malnutrition"},{"text":"Nutrition support"},{"text":"Treatment-related nutrition problems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Paediatric Dietitian"},{"type":"h","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Growth"},{"text":"Development"},{"text":"Childhood nutrition"},{"text":"Feeding difficulties"}]},{"type":"h","text":"6. Sports Dietitian"},{"type":"h","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sports performance"},{"text":"Recovery"},{"text":"Body composition"},{"text":"Competition nutrition"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Nutrition / Dietetics UG"},{"type":"h","text":"Junior / Clinical Dietitian"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Dietitian"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Clinical Dietitian"},{"type":"h","text":"Specialist Dietitian"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Nutrition Coordinator"},{"type":"h","text":"Nutrition Services Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Specialist pathway"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Dietitian"},{"type":"h","text":"Specialized Clinical Training"},{"type":"h","text":"Renal / ICU / Oncology / Paediatric / Diabetes"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Nutrition Lead"},{"type":"h","text":"Research pathway"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Dietitian"},{"type":"h","text":"Nutrition Research Assistant"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Nutrition Researcher"},{"type":"h","text":"Research Scientist"},{"type":"h","text":"Academic / Research Lead"},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging Technologies"},{"type":"p","text":"Clinical nutrition will increasingly use:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-assisted dietary analysis"},{"text":"Food-image recognition"},{"text":"Personalized nutrition algorithms"},{"text":"Continuous glucose monitoring"},{"text":"Wearable health data"},{"text":"Digital nutrition platforms"},{"text":"Remote diet counselling"},{"text":"Nutrigenomics"},{"text":"Precision nutrition"},{"text":"Digital biomarkers"},{"text":"Predictive metabolic analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest future-facing combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Clinical Nutrition","Metabolic Health","Data Analytics","Digital Health","Precision Nutrition"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Nutrition Science"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Human Nutrition"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Biochemistry"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Food Science"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Nutrient Metabolism"},{"type":"h","text":"└── Nutritional Assessment"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Nutrition"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Medical Nutrition Therapy"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Therapeutic Diets"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Diabetes"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Renal Nutrition"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Critical-Care Nutrition"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Oncology Nutrition"},{"type":"h","text":"└── Paediatric Nutrition"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Practice"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Nutrition Care Process"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Patient Counselling"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Behaviour Change"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Documentation"},{"type":"h","text":"└── Multidisciplinary Care"},{"type":"h","text":"Data & Technology"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Excel"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Nutrition Software"},{"type":"h","text":"├── EHR"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Power BI"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Statistics"},{"type":"h","text":"└── AI / Digital Nutrition"},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Evidence-Based Practice"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Research"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Communication"},{"type":"h","text":"├── Patient Education"},{"type":"h","text":"└── Clinical Ethics"},{"type":"h","text":"Target Profile by Graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should be able to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Perform structured nutrition assessments."},{"text":"Conduct dietary and anthropometric assessments."},{"text":"Develop therapeutic nutrition plans under appropriate clinical supervision."},{"text":"Understand medical nutrition therapy for common diseases."},{"text":"Understand diabetes, renal, cardiovascular, gastrointestinal and oncology nutrition."},{"text":"Understand enteral and parenteral nutrition fundamentals."},{"text":"Monitor nutritional and clinical outcomes."},{"text":"Counsel patients and caregivers effectively."},{"text":"Maintain accurate nutrition-care documentation."},{"text":"Work within multidisciplinary healthcare teams."},{"text":"Use EHR and nutrition-analysis systems."},{"text":"Apply Excel and basic data-analysis skills."},{"text":"Understand evidence-based nutrition practice."},{"text":"Complete substantial hospital and clinical internship exposure."},{"text":"Conduct a nutrition research or technology project."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"flow","items":["Recognized Nutrition/Dietetics UG","Clinical Dietitian","Hospital/Clinical Experience","Specialty Dietetics","Senior Clinical Dietitian","Clinical Nutrition Coordinator / Specialist"]},{"type":"p","text":"For the 2026+ healthcare environment, the strongest profile is a Clinical Dietitian combining therapeutic nutrition expertise with metabolic health, evidence-based practice, digital health, nutrition analytics and emerging precision-nutrition technologies."}]}]}